 e read stories and make them come alive with our bodies!\nJoin Megan Snide
 r\, author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspirin
 g stories and gets the whole family moving.\nClass begins and ends with so
 ng and breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kid
