DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T120000
UID:6a11f0d7caf93436005de173@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where we r
 ead stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Join Megan Snider\, 
 author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspiring st
 ories and gets the whole family moving.\nClass begins and ends with song a
 nd breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kids an
 d families can sit quietly and listen\, do partial poses or make up their 
 own\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga!\nNo experience\, mats\, or materi
 als required.  For children 12 and under with parents/caregivers.\nRegis
 tration required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informatio
 n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
 only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation.
  Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed 
 to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Str
 eet\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a11f0d7caf93436005de173
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
