BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movies - Karate Kid Legends
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T130000
UID:6a0e035943b41b3d0067e2f2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nKarate Kid Legends\nWhen kung fu p
 rodigy Li Fong relocates to New York City with his mother to attend a pres
 tigious new school\, he finds solace in a new friendship with a classmate 
 and her father. But his newfound peace is short-lived after he attracts un
 wanted attention from a formidable local karate champion. Driven by a desi
 re to defend himself\, Li embarks on a journey to enter the ultimate karat
 e competition. Guided by the wisdom of his king fu teacher\, Mr. Han\, and
  the legendary Karate Kid\, Daniel LaRusso\, Li merges their unique styles
  to prepare for an epic martial arts showdown.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0e035943b41b3d0067e2f2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movies - Ruby Gillman\, Teenage Kraken
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T130000
UID:6a0e04488ea300e263174763@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nRuby Gillman\, Teenage Kraken\nSwe
 et and awkward 16-year-old Ruby Gillman is desperate to fit in at school\,
  but she mostly just feels invisible. She's prevented from hanging out wit
 h the cool kids at the beach because her over-protective mom forbids her f
 rom getting in the water. When she breaks her mom's rule\, Ruby discovers 
 that she is a descendant of the warrior Kraken queens and is destined to i
 nherit the throne from her grandmother. The Kraken are sworn to protect th
 e world's oceans against vain\, power-hungry mermaids.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0e04488ea300e263174763
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
