DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260615T110000
UID:6a1206da8e677a28001e164a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Rainbow Storytime where we celebrate all
  children and families! This Storytime will include a range of inclusive b
 ooks\, stories\, songs and rhymes that foster acceptance\, embrace diversi
 ty\, and help get kids ready for reading! A simple craft will follow this 
 program. This program is suitable for children 5 years and under with a p
 arent or caregiver.
